1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,455
Today your community radio station is very pleased to invite you to the fifth CCR Veteran and Vintage Car Rally.

2
00:00:08,365 --> 00:00:20,475
Fifty-four absolutely beautiful, fully-restored vehicles from the beginning of the twentieth century will make their way from the rally point, in Federation Square, down to Exhibition Palace in Victoria Gardens.

3
00:00:21,615 --> 00:00:28,275
Cars will be arriving at Federation Square at 9:00 a. m. and will leave for Victoria Gardens at eleven o'clock.

4
00:00:28,915 --> 00:00:35,495
If you arrive at around 9:00 a. m., you will have a chance not only to inspect the cars but also to meet their owners.

5
00:00:36,635 --> 00:00:43,635
Entry into the Exhibition Building will cost five dollars for adults and two dollars for seniors and children under twelve years old.

6
00:00:44,315 --> 00:00:45,835
Don't miss this fabulous occasion!
